<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><br>Case {!Case.CaseNumber}'s current SLA is overdue.<br><br>To view the case please: <a href="{!$Label.Core_IPS_Notification_Internal_URL}/{!Case.Id}">Click Here</a><br><br></b><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>{!Case(Case.Core_IPS_Notif_Case_Comment__c,1, "This message was designed such that it contains no information which may be considered confidential.",2, "No comments have been added to this case.",3, "Latest Public Comment*",4, "Latest Private Comment*","")}</b><br>{!Case(Case.Core_IPS_Notif_Case_Comment__c,1, "",2, "",3, Case.Core_Last_Case_Comment__c,4, Case.Core_Last_Private_Case_Comment__c,"")}<br><b>{!Case(Case.Core_IPS_Notif_Case_Comment__c,1, "",2, "",3, "Submitted by: ",4, "Submitted by: ","")}</b>{!Case(Case.Core_IPS_Notif_Case_Comment__c,1, "",2, "",3, Case.Core_Last_Case_Comment_Submitter__c,4, Case.Core_Last_Private_Case_Comment_Submitter__c,"")}</span><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><br><br></b><div align="center"><font color="#666666"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">_______________________________________________________________</b></font><br><br><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Case Details</b><br></div><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><br>{!if(Case.Core_IPS_Restricted_Secret_Content__c,"","Subject:")}<br></b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!if(Case.Core_IPS_Restricted_Secret_Content__c,"",Case.Subject)}</span><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><br>{!if(Case.Core_IPS_Restricted_Secret_Content__c,"","Description: ")}<br></b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!if(Case.Core_IPS_Restricted_Secret_Content__c,"",Case.Core_Issue_Description__c)}</span><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><br><br><font size="2">Case Number: </font></b><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">{!Case.CaseNumber}</font></span><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><br>Status{!if(ispickval(Case.Core_Sub_Status__c,""),": "," - Sub Status: ")}</font></b><span style="